[2026-01-30T15:48:45.781Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Implementation: Build advanced force-directed graph with hierarchical clustering, path finding, and dynamic layout algorithms\n\n## Context Area\nNetwork & Relationship Graphs\n\n## Description\nBuild advanced force-directed graph with hierarchical clustering, path finding, and dynamic layout algorithms\n\n## Implementation Details\n\n## Advanced Force-Directed Graph with Hierarchical Clustering\n\n### Vision\nUpgrade the network visualization into a professional-grade force-directed graph with advanced layout algorithms, hierarchical clustering, shortest path finding, and dynamic grouping capabilities. Support graphs with 500+ nodes without performance degradation.\n\n### Business Value\n- Essential for complex investigation mapping\n- Reveals hidden connection patterns\n- Path finding accelerates insight discovery\n- Clustering reduces cognitive overload\n- Professional-grade tool for analysts\n\n### Scope\n**Included:**\n- Advanced force-directed layout (d3-force with WebGL)\n- Hierarchical clustering with expandable groups\n- Shortest path highlighting between nodes\n- Multiple layout algorithms (force, radial, hierarchical)\n- Node filtering by type, confidence, connections\n- Edge bundling for complex graphs\n- Minimap navigation for large graphs\n- Node search with highlight\n- Export graph as image/JSON\n- Performance optimization for 500+ nodes\n\n**Out of Scope:**\n- Graph editing (add/remove nodes)\n- External graph database integration\n\n### Key Components\n1. **AdvancedNetworkGraph** - Main WebGL-powered graph container\n2. **HierarchicalClusterer** - Auto-group related nodes\n3. **PathFinder** - Shortest path algorithm implementation\n4. **LayoutSwitcher** - Switch between layout algorithms\n5. **EdgeBundler** - Reduce visual clutter in dense graphs\n6. **GraphMinimap** - Overview navigation panel\n7. **NodeSearcher** - Find and highlight nodes\n8. **GraphFilterPanel** - Filter by attributes\n9. **GraphExporter** - Export visualization\n\n### Technical Approach\n- Sigma.js or react-force-graph for WebGL rendering\n- d3-force for physics simulation\n- Louvain algorithm for community detection\n- Dijkstra/A* for path finding\n- Edge bundling via FDEB algorithm\n- Canvas rendering fallback for older browsers\n- Web Worker for layout computation\n- Progressive rendering for large graphs\n\n### Files to Create/Modify\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/AdvancedNetworkGraph.tsx`\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/HierarchicalClusterer.tsx`\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/PathFinder.tsx`\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/LayoutSwitcher.tsx`\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/EdgeBundler.tsx`\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/GraphMinimap.tsx`\n- Create: `src/lib/graphAlgorithms.ts`\n- Create: `src/workers/graphLayout.worker.ts`\n- Create: `src/hooks/useForceGraph.ts`\n- Modify: NetworkGraph.tsx - Upgrade to new system\n\n### Success Criteria\n- 500+ nodes render at 30+ fps\n- Clusters form meaningful groups\n- Path finding identifies relevant routes\n- Layout algorithms produce clear visualizations\n- Edge bundling reduces visual clutter\n- Minimap accurately represents graph\n- Search finds nodes instantly\n- Export produces high-quality images\n\n### Potential Challenges\n- WebGL compatibility on older devices\n- Layout stability during interactions\n- Path finding performance for large graphs\n- Cluster label positioning\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Read and understand the implementation details above\n2. Identify all files that need to be modified\n3. Implement the changes following the guidance provided\n4. Ensure code quality and type safety\n5. Test the changes work as expected\n\n## Notes\n\nThis requirement was generated from an accepted Development Direction.\nFocus on implementing exactly what is described above.\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb700aba-f9fc-4283-93cf-561e37220b63","uuid":"7e0ecef0-5660-4760-9e75-67a1d4d7560f","isSynthetic":true}
