[2026-01-30T16:01:59.707Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01LhRnCACtK6SnAtve5NRa6q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have successfully implemented the advanced force-directed graph visualization system. Here's a summary of what was created:\n\n## Summary of Implementation\n\n### Core Files Created:\n\n1. **`src/lib/graphAlgorithms.ts`** - Graph algorithms library containing:\n   - Louvain community detection for hierarchical clustering\n   - Dijkstra shortest path algorithm\n   - Force-Directed Edge Bundling (FDEB)\n   - Multiple layout algorithms (force, radial, hierarchical)\n   - Utility functions (getBounds, getNeighborhood, getGraphStats)\n\n2. **`src/workers/graphLayout.worker.ts`** - Web Worker for offloading heavy computations:\n   - Force-directed layout with Barnes-Hut optimization\n   - Radial and hierarchical layouts\n   - Louvain clustering\n   - Edge bundling\n   - Path finding\n   - Progress reporting and cancellation support\n\n3. **`src/hooks/useForceGraph.ts`** - React hook for graph state management:\n   - View state (zoom, pan)\n   - Selection management\n   - Filtering\n   - Layout operations\n   - Path finding\n   - Node interactions (drag, pin, highlight)\n   - Worker communication\n\n### UI Components Created:\n\n4. **`src/components/report/visualizations/network/AdvancedNetworkGraph.tsx`** - Main component:\n   - Canvas-based rendering optimized for 500+ nodes\n   - Cluster visualization\n   - Edge bundling support\n   - Path highlighting\n   - Interactive node selection and dragging\n   - Zoom/pan controls\n\n5. **`src/components/report/visualizations/network/GraphMinimap.tsx`** - Overview navigation panel\n\n6. **`src/components/report/visualizations/network/LayoutSwitcher.tsx`** - Layout algorithm selector (Force/Radial/Tree)\n\n7. **`src/components/report/visualizations/network/GraphFilterPanel.tsx`** - Filter by node/edge types and connections\n\n8. **`src/components/report/visualizations/network/PathFinder.tsx`** - Shortest path finding interface\n\n9. **`src/components/report/visualizations/network/GraphExporter.tsx`** - Export to PNG/SVG/JSON\n\n10. **`src/components/report/visualizations/network/index.tsx`** - Module exports\n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n\n- **Performance**: Web Worker offloads computation, Barnes-Hut optimization for large graphs\n- **Layout Algorithms**: Force-directed, radial, and hierarchical layouts\n- **Clustering**: Louvain algorithm for automatic community detection\n- **Path Finding**: Dijkstra's algorithm with visual highlighting\n- **Edge Bundling**: FDEB algorithm to reduce visual clutter\n- **Interactions**: Drag nodes, zoom/pan, selection, double-click to select neighbors\n- **Filtering**: By node type, edge type, minimum connections\n- **Search**: Node search with dropdown results\n- **Export**: PNG, SVG, and JSON export options\n- **Minimap**: Overview navigation for large graphs\n- **Theme Support**: Integrates with existing radar/swiss theme system"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":610,"cache_read_input_tokens":116867,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":610},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb700aba-f9fc-4283-93cf-561e37220b63","uuid":"ee30183b-7fd0-41ca-92e2-31326ae8c93d"}
